  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Domestic Resource Mobilization Modernization Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will help the Government of the Lao PDR strengthen its domestic resource mobilization (DRM) capacity to address macroeconomic vulnerabilities by (i) modernizing taxpayer services through digital transformation, (ii) developing computerized accounting and electronic invoicing (e-invoicing) systems, (iii) enhancing data analytics, and (iv) establishing a tax academy.</narrative>
  </description>
